    choice('What is the main purpose of the passage?', ['To recommend replacing all learning with timed tests', 'To explain how several practice methods can guide better study decisions', 'To prove that rereading has no role in learning', 'To present one universal revision timetable'], 1, '全文解释提取、反馈、间隔、混合练习与自我校准，H 段强调组合使用。')
